Package: parceldata
Type: Package
Title: Read the Twin Cities Regional Parcels, 2005-2025
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew", "Hockert", email = "MatthewHockert@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download the standardized MetroGIS 7-county parcel files from
    Zenodo (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24116899) and read them by year, county and
    column, as polygons or points, with the original or standardized field
    names. Includes a column lister and a net tax capacity estimator.
License: file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MatthewHockert/parcel_data
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    sf,
    arrow,
    dplyr
Encoding: UTF-8
